  "vibe": "A barbershop with brass fittings. #1b2838 navy walls, #f4eee4 cream, pole red #c8433b, and a #caa24f gold used only for trim. Abril Fatface stamps titles down hard; Work Sans handles the detail. The world stands a barber's pole at the right whose skewed red-and-navy stripes scroll endlessly upward between gold end caps, opens and closes a pair of steel scissors with gold finger-rings at lower-left on a 2.2Hz rhythm, chases five gold bulbs across the upper-left, and rules a steel shelf line under a comb-wave squiggle. Statement beats flood full pole red with cream copy; the CTA flips to full cream with a navy block button. Cards are near-black navy frames carrying gold and steel outline chips. The camera zooms and drops at a lively but controlled magnitude. Owns a slider Cursor, board Scroll, side Notify and flap Morphs. For barbers, salons, tattoo studios and heritage service trades.",
